       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "-Game will be paused when player turn on the Steam overlay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "-Edited 1 line text on Japanese and English version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Fixed the windowed mode setting, so if player switch from Full screen to Windowed, the resolution won't be the same with the full screen resolution.",
